                        "form": "велосипеди́сте"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "be13eedf-71cc-4973-b10a-26610dd1c466",
                        "entry_id": "2b980696-8933-3fcb-a76c-d18f99b3d10c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "велосипеди́стах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f6a1680c-5de5-3b09-a4cb-84d13aea5339",
                        "entry_id": "2b980696-8933-3fcb-a76c-d18f99b3d10c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "человек, едущий на велосипеде, использующий велосипед для перемещения или перевозки чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "08530a2b-caa3-41d3-9b15-0d85d9e092bd",
                                "sense_id": "f6a1680c-5de5-3b09-a4cb-84d13aea5339",
                                "text": "Время от времени среди толпы появлялся велосипедист, одетый медведем, монахом, обезьяной или Пьеро, на жабо которого тотчас приклеивались эти метко бросаемые цепкие колючие шарики."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dacf4866-3f38-44b2-9186-09a8ba3e26b8",
                                "sense_id": "f6a1680c-5de5-3b09-a4cb-84d13aea5339",
                                "text": "Велосипедисты, как правило, едут без красного сигнала."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4841f65-8f02-41e4-b656-9e714cd66794",
                                "sense_id": "f6a1680c-5de5-3b09-a4cb-84d13aea5339",
                                "text": "У Акантова не было при полку ни конных разведчиков, ни велосипедистов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da24d84d-a3a7-4246-b3c6-c34c6d2a17ae",
                                "sense_id": "f6a1680c-5de5-3b09-a4cb-84d13aea5339",
                                "text": "— Знаешь, утром я чуть не сбил велосипедиста."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6a1ebf6-8354-3598-bfdd-f0d56d6ad7f2",
                        "entry_id": "2b980696-8933-3fcb-a76c-d18f99b3d10c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спорт. спортсмен, занимающийся велосипедным спортом; участник гонки на велосипедах"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d4b7ee9-f7c1-4a9e-96ec-46c957cffda0",
                                "sense_id": "c6a1ebf6-8354-3598-bfdd-f0d56d6ad7f2",
                                "text": "Наша задача тем более ответственна, что велосипедисты открывают Олимпиаду — первые медали получат победители в шоссейной гонке на 100 километров."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a43fa4e-9bf2-4a5f-b80a-2f51a16a4ff0",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b980696-8933-3fcb-a76c-d18f99b3d10c",
                        "source_sense_description": "человек, едущий на велосипеде, использующий велосипед для перемещения или перевозки чего-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "biker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "biker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74635f8f-253e-388c-9d65-49f0e235febc",
                                        "entry_id": "401d2f42-13b1-3c65-9b0d-d9fcb49700eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person whose lifestyle is centered on motorcycles, sometimes a member of a motorcycle club."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7b07fb8-dc32-4561-a675-758345643199",
                                                "sense_id": "74635f8f-253e-388c-9d65-49f0e235febc",
                                                "text": "Others, mostly behelmeted casual bikers whose enthusiasm for motorcycling is a monthly Sunday morning ride, also took in the gleam of the chrome and outrageous styling, but were confused that it had a Honda badge on it rather than Harley’s winged logo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "977e5324-5ac7-468a-8796-4f1b30256fa0",
                                                "sense_id": "74635f8f-253e-388c-9d65-49f0e235febc",
                                                "text": "There’s a wonderful sketch of a formidable biker called “Roundhouse,” who is “humongously fat and hasn’t had a haircut since third grade.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c5c9fe1-878b-439f-ba6f-dd2be809f9f4",
                                                "sense_id": "74635f8f-253e-388c-9d65-49f0e235febc",
                                                "text": "Bikers did what bikers do. They raced around and popped wheelies. The state police were called in to clear the town.\nThe event got big play in Life magazine and inspired the 1953 film “The Wild One,” starring Marlon Brando. His leather jacket and brooding demeanor gave a face to the bad-boy biker image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dbc6b0c-0ff6-3eac-b7e3-5b07071d9325",
                                        "entry_id": "401d2f42-13b1-3c65-9b0d-d9fcb49700eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cyclist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f200aa1d-1ecd-4147-a520-0db31f4edbf1",
                                                "sense_id": "4dbc6b0c-0ff6-3eac-b7e3-5b07071d9325",
                                                "text": "Lots of pockets help with a commute, a storm hood is great if you get caught in a storm on a hike, weight and packability are essential for backpackers and if you’re a climber or biker, you’ll want a helmet-compatible hood."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c9cba647-631e-42ee-ad09-991ea2677e1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b980696-8933-3fcb-a76c-d18f99b3d10c",
                        "source_sense_description": "человек, едущий на велосипеде, использующий велосипед для перемещения или перевозки чего-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "cyclist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cyclist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a77c9781-627f-3e08-ac92-01fef39824e8",
                                        "entry_id": "c7301625-fd05-33f0-9735-d0e2ecc79011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who rides a cycle, especially a bicycle, or who habitually engages in cycling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86b53b58-04a3-480f-a9f8-dea89db7059c",
                                                "sense_id": "a77c9781-627f-3e08-ac92-01fef39824e8",
                                                "text": "A solitary cyclist was coming towards us. His head was down and his shoulders rounded, as he put every ounce of energy that he possessed on to the pedals. He was flying like a racer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9a0e9d0-82a9-3827-9d42-2dee0701ff30",
                                        "entry_id": "c7301625-fd05-33f0-9735-d0e2ecc79011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A motorcyclist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8382e2db-c5f5-4929-9754-a8eb64110c1e",
                                                "sense_id": "e9a0e9d0-82a9-3827-9d42-2dee0701ff30",
                                                "text": "Most of the cyclists were members of the Pagans' Motorcycle Club of Washington."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b496cb5f-7010-4238-9f0c-95d4ca657075",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b980696-8933-3fcb-a76c-d18f99b3d10c",
                        "source_sense_description": "человек, едущий на велосипеде, использующий велосипед для перемещения или перевозки чего-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "Radfahrer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Radfahrer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24111d84-c186-3352-bcd7-04265d92b0f3",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f41d9c-105a-38f0-aab5-f324811f3f7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der mit dem Fahrrad fährt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "900d88f7-cdd1-4138-8020-160e051392c3",
                                                "sense_id": "24111d84-c186-3352-bcd7-04265d92b0f3",
                                                "text": "Auch als Radfahrer muss man auf den Verkehr achten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf369897-2bd3-4515-a563-2338aeb83d01",
                                                "sense_id": "24111d84-c186-3352-bcd7-04265d92b0f3",
                                                "text": "„Die Bergwanderer in der Provence feuern jeden Radfahrer, der an ihnen vorbeikriecht, mit allez! allez! an.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c7293dc-70bc-417c-9ca3-8407b043b6d2",
                                                "sense_id": "24111d84-c186-3352-bcd7-04265d92b0f3",
                                                "text": "„Nachdenklich zieht er sein Portemonnaie hervor, nimmt zwei Zehnpfennigstücke heraus und zieht an einem grünen Automaten neben dem der Wahrsagerin eine Packung Pfefferminz.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f07fc05e-2b3b-4afd-a163-dd60c89bb7ad",
                                                "sense_id": "24111d84-c186-3352-bcd7-04265d92b0f3",
                                                "text": "„Ein Radfahrer fiel ihm auf, der »energisch« an ihm vorbeifuhr.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5180668d-db2a-4ba2-b6fb-3f9c4ca26845",
                                                "sense_id": "24111d84-c186-3352-bcd7-04265d92b0f3",
                                                "text": "„Vollends zum Problemkreisel wird der Stern aber erst durch einen Verkehrsteilnehmer, der sich – vielerorts und gerade in Bremen politisch angefeuert – zunehmend bemerkbar macht: den Radfahrer.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
